					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					14.10.25
				</span></i>
			 : generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα προστάττουσιν [οἱ
				νόμοι] ἀκριβῶς π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				53.10
			</span></i>.</div>
